# Ajani's Pridemate: "Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (a 2/2) and then
# gains 3 life with Healing Salve: one counter, not three (3/3, CR 603.2c: one trigger per life gain event, however much). When
# Bot2 gains 3 life with a Salve of their own on turn 2 the Pridemate does not change (a positive control that only its
# controller's life gain counts), and a second Salve for Bot1 on turn 3 makes it a 4/4 with two counters.

